{
    "0": {
        "0_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<ts$Ariya  $Marisa  $Koishi  >The bottom of the Asama Impurity-Cleansing Mountain."
            ]
        },
        "1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "After a painful battle, Marisa Kirisame",
                "defeated Ariya Iwanaga, the unchanging goddess."
            ]
        },
        "6_0": {
            "lines": [
                "However..."
            ]
        },
        "7_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >...a massive flood of impurity from the Outside World will flow in."
            ]
        },
        "8_0": {
            "lines": [
                "How that affects things—that depends on you."
            ]
        },
        "10_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >Why don't you witness Gensokyo's changes with your own eyes?"
            ]
        },
        "35_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<c$Congratulations!$>",
                "<c$Congratulations on your No Continue Clear!$>"
            ]
        },
        "2_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >That Incident Stone was real, after all."
            ]
        },
        "11_0": {
            "lines": [
                "In the forest of the Sanctuaries."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hidden by forest of the Sanctuaries is the pyramid."
            ]
        },
        "13_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >Nothing strange in the Sanctuaries...Hey you over there!"
            ]
        },
        "14_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Koishi  >Hm?"
            ]
        },
        "15_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >What's someone from the underground like you doing here?"
            ]
        },
        "16_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Koishi  >Oh? Oh? You can see me? For real?"
            ]
        },
        "17_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Koishi  >Normally you shouldn't be able to."
            ]
        },
        "18_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And I was having so much fun too."
            ]
        },
        "19_0": {
            "lines": [
                "How embarrassing."
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >I can't understand what you're saying, but what are you up to around here?"
            ]
        },
        "21_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Koishi  >I was just passing by.",
                "<l$> The barrier around here was vanished recently."
            ]
        },
        "22_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >Oh yeah, the barrier came down when the incident was resolved."
            ]
        },
        "23_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I've been investigating ever since."
            ]
        },
        "24_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I guess it's all good if you're just passing by."
            ]
        },
        "25_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Koishi  >What's this? Why is big sister there?"
            ]
        },
        "26_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >Huh? I don't see anyone."
            ]
        },
        "27_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Koishi  >No way, I can sense her presence in your pocket."
            ]
        },
        "28_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >W-w-what!?"
            ]
        },
        "29_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, could it be..."
            ]
        },
        "33_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Perhaps Koshi's ability to become imperceivable was weakened by the power of unchanging."
            ]
        },
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<c$ Ending No.13 Pocket Satori>"
            ]
        },
        "31_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Just as Koishi said, the unsettling aura emanated by the stone was that of Satori's."
            ]
        },
        "32_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Moreover, the usually invisible Koishi was somehow perceivable today."
            ]
        },
        "30_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The presence of her big sister, Komeiji Satori, was in fact the Incident Stone."
            ]
        }
    }
}